# BACKEND

Use Node.js + Express + TypeScript + Sequelize + MySQL.

Controllers are thin.
Services contain business logic.
Repositories contain database access where applicable.
Validators validate external input.
Routes define HTTP contracts.

Use transactions for operations affecting multiple domain records.

Apply:
authentication
authorization
tenant isolation
validation
audit logging

Do not expose raw database errors.

Do not use client company_id as the security boundary.
